This package repackages Apple's SF Mono font (downloaded from
https://developer.apple.com/fonts/), patched with the Nerd Fonts patcher
(https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts, MIT-licensed) to add extra glyphs.

Apple does not publish a plain-text license file inside the font
installer; the applicable terms are the ones presented on the download
page above at the time of download. Those terms do not clearly permit
redistribution of the font, modified or not, outside of software built
for Apple's own platforms. This package is marked "restricted" for that
reason: the official Void Linux builders will refuse to build it, and
it is intended for local, personal use only, not for redistribution.

The Nerd Fonts patcher itself is MIT-licensed; see
https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts/blob/master/LICENSE.
